A1.2 – Definición de IA
   - Definition: Determines whether the document includes an explicit definition of Artificial Intelligence.
   - Options:
       * "Incluye definición de IA" → The document explicitly defines what constitutes AI, artificial intelligence, or intelligent systems.
       * "No incluye definición de IA" → The document does not provide a definition of AI, or only mentions AI without defining it.
   - Decision rule: Look for sections titled "Definiciones", "Artículo X - Definiciones", or explicit statements like "se entiende por Inteligencia Artificial" or "Inteligencia Artificial es".
     If such definitions are present → choose "Incluye definición de IA".
     If AI is mentioned but not defined → choose "No incluye definición de IA".
   - Key indicators: Look for definition sections, articles with definitions, or explicit statements about what AI means in the context of the law.

